# Vazhi Thunai - AI Smart Women Safety

## Problem Statement
Women safety during emergency situations requires quick response and instant access to help. Existing solutions may require manual actions that are difficult during critical moments.

## Proposed Solution
Vazhi Thunai is an AI-powered women safety application that provides instant SOS alerts, voice-based emergency activation, live location sharing, and safety assistance features.

## Key Features
- One-tap SOS emergency alert
- Voice trigger SOS activation
- Live location sharing
- AI-based safe route assistance
- Emergency support system

## Tech Stack

### Frontend
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

### Backend
- Python
- FastAPI

### Tools & APIs
- GitHub
- Location APIs
- Voice Processing

## How to Run

1. Clone the repository

2. Install required dependencies

3. Start the backend server

4. Run the frontend application

